{"4818620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WBS26 Wrestling Booker Simulator", "steam_appid": 4818620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4819710], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every booking is a promise. Every finish has a cost.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrestling Booker Simulator 26 puts you behind the curtain of a living wrestling world. Take control of a real-world promotion included with permission or create your own, then make the calls that shape careers, divide locker rooms and turn ordinary matches into history.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/8b94a5ae95fa220daffdd44401f4a646.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/8b94a5ae95fa220daffdd44401f4a646.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/36979d22a4f975793a4e5dbdf77469da.poster.avif?t=1784349032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/36979d22a4f975793a4e5dbdf77469da.webm?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/36979d22a4f975793a4e5dbdf77469da.mp4?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of finances, venues, ticket prices, sponsors, broadcast deals, production, academies and brand direction. Meet owner objectives, build popularity region by region and outmaneuver rival promotions—without losing the locker room, the fans or your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/6ba76e638442db24ce8ffbbc2e05107d.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/6ba76e638442db24ce8ffbbc2e05107d.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build weekly cards and major events from matches and promos. Choose from dozens of stipulations, set the stakes and finishes, use interference and post-match angles, balance pacing and budget, or let your booking assistant assemble a starting card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/15e911a6d0a5c0a0c8a64a3f9f06400d.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/15e911a6d0a5c0a0c8a64a3f9f06400d.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/cacb69612d97a5b8ccc217f7b42f45ab.poster.avif?t=1784349032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/cacb69612d97a5b8ccc217f7b42f45ab.webm?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/cacb69612d97a5b8ccc217f7b42f45ab.mp4?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout free agents, academy prospects and rising names from around the world. Negotiate against rival offers: talent weighs money, contract type, promised role, creative control, bonuses, your reputation and the way you treat the locker room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Build Rivalries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn matches, promos, factions, betrayals and face or heel turns into stories with heat, investment and momentum. Let feuds grow into signature rivalries—or watch them burn out through repetition, weak finishes and overexposure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/64bf869e1fca68c61da33ef35207e476.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/64bf869e1fca68c61da33ef35207e476.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your title scene, choose champions, book defenses and tournaments, and follow every lineage. Each reign develops a quality—from weak to legendary—shaped by opponent strength, match quality, finishes, storyline heat, champion credibility and how actively the title is defended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/37f60ff2ff2efd1ac2e07630732dd285.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/37f60ff2ff2efd1ac2e07630732dd285.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer exclusive, non-exclusive or short-term deals and negotiate salary, bonuses, roles, creative control and promises. Track expiring contracts, respond to counteroffers and decide which stars are worth fighting for when rival promotions come calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/dbf7db1f4dba7b0f38bf1738d0f5c809.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/dbf7db1f4dba7b0f38bf1738d0f5c809.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locker room has a social life of its own. Cliques form, veterans become peacemakers or gatekeepers, protégés gain protection, jealousies spread and one unpopular decision can affect morale, relationships, contract risk and future storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/8b59e43d626970645feebd7f3487bfce.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/8b59e43d626970645feebd7f3487bfce.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/780a66b8b088e58e9bd22b63f7d584b5.poster.avif?t=1784349032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/780a66b8b088e58e9bd22b63f7d584b5.webm?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/780a66b8b088e58e9bd22b63f7d584b5.mp4?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your booking come alive through procedural 3D broadcasts with entrances, changing venues, animated crowds, commentary, camera cuts, near falls, signature finishers, replays and post-match scenes. Pause the action, change the speed or skip ahead whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/cbdeccdb795dd424d395526466fc1f16.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/cbdeccdb795dd424d395526466fc1f16.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world remembers clean losses, dirty wins, title thefts, betrayals, interference, humiliations, injuries and broken promises. Memories fade, intensify or resurface in the news—changing backstage tension, contract pressure, rematch interest and the stories your roster wants to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/71b0e1269dc1367329097ff73f04fcb3.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/71b0e1269dc1367329097ff73f04fcb3.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a booker reputation in ratings, business, talent relations and integrity. Bigger promotions may try to poach you; a dismissal does not end the world or erase its history. Change jobs, win annual awards, create Hall of Fame careers and leave a legacy that survives every company you lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Real-world promotions</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The real-world promotions currently represented in WBS26—Ukrainian Wrestling Arena (UWA), Fight Factory Pro Wrestling (FFPW), Over The Top Wrestling (OTT), Prime Time Wrestling (PTW), SLAM! Wrestling Entertainment, and Hungarian Championship Wrestling (HCW)—are included with permission. Their names, logos, trademarks and related materials remain the property of the respective promotions and rights holders.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every booking is a promise. Every finish has a cost.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrestling Booker Simulator 26 puts you behind the curtain of a living wrestling world. Take control of a real-world promotion included with permission or create your own, then make the calls that shape careers, divide locker rooms and turn ordinary matches into history.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/8b94a5ae95fa220daffdd44401f4a646.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/8b94a5ae95fa220daffdd44401f4a646.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/36979d22a4f975793a4e5dbdf77469da.poster.avif?t=1784349032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/36979d22a4f975793a4e5dbdf77469da.webm?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/36979d22a4f975793a4e5dbdf77469da.mp4?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of finances, venues, ticket prices, sponsors, broadcast deals, production, academies and brand direction. Meet owner objectives, build popularity region by region and outmaneuver rival promotions—without losing the locker room, the fans or your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/6ba76e638442db24ce8ffbbc2e05107d.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/6ba76e638442db24ce8ffbbc2e05107d.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build weekly cards and major events from matches and promos. Choose from dozens of stipulations, set the stakes and finishes, use interference and post-match angles, balance pacing and budget, or let your booking assistant assemble a starting card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/15e911a6d0a5c0a0c8a64a3f9f06400d.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/15e911a6d0a5c0a0c8a64a3f9f06400d.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/cacb69612d97a5b8ccc217f7b42f45ab.poster.avif?t=1784349032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/cacb69612d97a5b8ccc217f7b42f45ab.webm?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/cacb69612d97a5b8ccc217f7b42f45ab.mp4?t=1784349032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout free agents, academy prospects and rising names from around the world. Negotiate against rival offers: talent weighs money, contract type, promised role, creative control, bonuses, your reputation and the way you treat the locker room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Build Rivalries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn matches, promos, factions, betrayals and face or heel turns into stories with heat, investment and momentum. Let feuds grow into signature rivalries—or watch them burn out through repetition, weak finishes and overexposure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras/64bf869e1fca68c61da33ef35207e476.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_b