ff73f04fcb3.avif?t=1784349032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/extras_big/71b0e1269dc1367329097ff73f04fcb3.webp?t=1784349032 width=1560 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a booker reputation in ratings, business, talent relations and integrity. Bigger promotions may try to poach you; a dismissal does not end the world or erase its history. Change jobs, win annual awards, create Hall of Fame careers and leave a legacy that survives every company you lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Real-world promotions</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The real-world promotions currently represented in WBS26—Ukrainian Wrestling Arena (UWA), Fight Factory Pro Wrestling (FFPW), Over The Top Wrestling (OTT), Prime Time Wrestling (PTW), SLAM! Wrestling Entertainment, and Hungarian Championship Wrestling (HCW)—are included with permission. Their names, logos, trademarks and related materials remain the property of the respective promotions and rights holders.</i></p>", "short_description": "WBS26 is a wrestling promotion management simulator where you control shows, rosters, contracts, titles, finances, and backstage drama. Build stars, create rivalries, survive crises, and shape the future of your promotion. #BookItBetter", "supported_languages": "English, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/ba4f99536662013f52b87738741c08837324e6dd/header.jpg?t=1784349032", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/1bcf06c69a22931fa7267e5a76c4c878b3e07f5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784349032", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4818620/1bcf06c69a22931fa7267e5a76c4c878b3e07f5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784349032", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows